WEBVTT

00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:31.820
A: Rory and the storm. the wind howled the sky was dark leaves flew through the air like frightened birds something was happening in the jungle something big animals were rushing to safety monkeys swung through the trees birds flew high into the sky even the strong elephants were moving fast in the middle of it all stood a small lion cub Rory He wasn't running.

00:00:31.820 --> 00:00:51.020
A: He wasn't hiding. He He was staring straight at the towering towering trees, where a faint cry for help echoed through the storm. Earlier that day, Rory had been playing with his best friend, Naya the parrot, near the cliffs. They had laughed, chased butterflies, and watched clouds dance.

00:00:51.020 --> 00:01:55.980
A: But now everything has changed. changed. The storm had come without warning. Nia had tried to fly home, but the wind was too strong. she'd been blown off course and now she was stuck in the highest tree in the jungle most animals would have run to shelter most cubs would have called for an adult but Rory wasn't like most cubs he was afraid but but he didn't let fear decide for him he took a deep breath feeling his tiny heart beat fast The branches swayed wildly and thunder rumbled above but still he climbed higher and higher his paws slipping his fur soaked from the rain the tree groaned in the wind below animals watched watched in silence too scared to move but up there Rory didn't think about who was watching he thought only about his friend Nia's tiny voice came through the leaves Rory, I'm scared.

00:01:57.020 --> 00:02:18.540
A: Rory didn't shout back. He kept climbing. At last he reached the branch where Nia was trembling. She had wrapped her wings around the trunk too afraid to move. Rory crouched low and gently nudged her. Without saying a word he helped her climb onto his back he whispered we're going home.

00:02:19.740 --> 00:02:54.700
A: And slowly step by step they made their way down. When they reached the ground the animals cheered not just because Rory had saved Nia but because they had seen courage with their own eyes Rory had been scared very scared but he didn't let fear stop him from doing what was right that day everyone in the jungle learned something important courage isn't about being fearless it's about doing the right thing even when you're afraid

